            "title": "Meta, Tesla Headline Earnings In Busy Week For Markets",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\">Get ahead of the market by subscribing to Seeking Alpha's Wall Street Week Ahead, a preview of key events scheduled for the coming week. The newsletter keeps you informed of the biggest stories set to make headlines, including upcoming IPOs, investor days, earnings reports, and conference presentations.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Wall Street’s major market averages were lower on Friday as technology stocks came under further pressure amid an already challenging trading week. A pullback in artificial intelligence-related stocks has weighed on the broader market this week, with memory chip stocks among the hardest-hit segments as investors reassessed the sector's recent performance.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">The economic calendar is relatively lighter for the coming week as earnings take center stage with major data releases concentrated towards the latter half of the week. Initial jobless claims will be released on Thursday, while S&amp;P Global PMI data for October is due on Friday.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">Firms including Meta (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/META\" title=\"Meta Platforms, Inc.\">META</a>), Tesla (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TSLA\" title=\"Tesla, Inc.\">TSLA</a>), IBM (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/IBM\" title=\"International Business Machines Corporation\">IBM</a>), and Netflix (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NFLX\" title=\"Netflix, Inc.\">NFLX</a>) are scheduled to report their results next week.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\">______________________________________________________________</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Tuesday: GE Aerospace (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GE\" title=\"General Electric Company\">GE</a>), Netflix, 3M (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MMM\" title=\"3M Company\">MMM</a>), United Airlines (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/UAL\" title=\"United Airlines Holdings, Inc.\">UAL</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Wednesday: Philip Morris (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PM\" title=\"Philip Morris International Inc.\">PM</a>), Meta, Tesla, IBM, AT&amp;T (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/T\" title=\"AT&amp;T Inc.\">T</a>), Kinder Morgan (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/KMI\" title=\"Kinder Morgan, Inc.\">KMI</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Thursday: P&amp;G (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PG\" title=\"The Procter &amp; Gamble Company\">PG</a>), Western Digital (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WDC\" title=\"Western Digital Corporation\">WDC</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Earnings spotlight:</b> Friday: ExxonMobil (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/XOM\" title=\"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation\">XOM</a>), American Express (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AXP\" title=\"American Express Company\">AXP</a>). <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar#hasComeFromMpArticle=false\">See the full earnings calendar</a>.</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Volatility watch:</b> Dell (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DELL\" title=\"Dell Technologies Inc.\">DELL</a>) and Ciena (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CIEN\" title=\"Ciena Corporation\">CIEN</a>) have seen options volatility increase over the last week. The most overbought stocks per their 14-day Relative Strength Index include Bumble (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BMBL\" title=\"Bumble Inc.\">BMBL</a>) and Sweetgreen (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SG\" title=\"Sweetgreen, Inc.\">SG</a>). The most oversold stocks per their 14-day Relative Strength Index include Global Net Lease (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GNL\" title=\"Global Net Lease, Inc.\">GNL</a>) and Glass House Brands (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GLAS\" title=\"Glass House Brands Inc.\">GLAS</a>). Short interest is elevated on Serve Robotics (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SERV\" title=\"Serve Robotics Inc.\">SERV</a>) and Sunrun (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RUN\" title=\"Sunrun Inc.\">RUN</a>).</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Dividend watch:</b> Companies that have an ex-dividend date coming next week</p></body></html>",
